## PROJECT CONTEXT

You are working on a production-grade Ecommerce ERP system.

Technology Stack

- Laravel 13
- PHP 8.4+
- MySQL 8+
- Vue 3 Composition API
- Pinia
- Vue Router
- Tailwind CSS
- AdminLTE (Admin Panel Only)
- Sanctum Authentication
- Vite

Never use technologies outside this stack unless requested.

------------------------------------------

## GENERAL AI RULES

Always think before writing code.

Never guess.

Never create incomplete code.

Never leave TODO comments.

Never generate placeholder code.

Never skip validation.

Always produce production-ready code.

Always follow SOLID principles.

Always follow DRY.

Always follow KISS.

Always follow Clean Architecture.

Always optimize readability first.

Never duplicate business logic.

------------------------------------------

